  <revision rev="6" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>883048fd5b67a73fea10cbce62c9caf4</srcmd5>
    <version>3.5.1</version>
    <time>1792492856</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to version 3.5.1
  * Added video panning using middle-click drag or Shift+Scroll
  * Added video zooming using Ctrl+Scroll or touchpad gestures
  * Added option to copy or save rendered subtitles with transparency
  * Added style options for high decimal precision and border style 4
  * Added syntax highlighting for vector clips and drawings
  * Added shortcut to insert hard space via Ctrl+Shift+Space
  * Fixed screen color picker on macOS and Wayland
  * Fixed startup crash on macOS 13 and native module loading
  * Fixed security vulnerability regarding arbitrary code execution
  * Updated translations and added Lithuanian support
- Switch LuaJIT dependency to Meson wrap package
- Build LuaJIT statically via Meson fallback subproject
- Add pkgconfig(libportal-gtk3) build dependency
- Add unzip build dependency and drop zstd
- Disable LTO build option (b_lto=false)
- Dynamically set BUILD_GIT_VERSION_STRING to RPM version
</comment>
    <requestid>1386275</requestid>
